"https://api.github.com/users/tedyu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tedyu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tedyu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tedyu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tedyu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/782729565","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/6821#issuecomment-782729565","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/6821","id":782729565,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDc4MjcyOTU2NQ==","user":{"login":"tedyu","id":235188,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNTE4OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/235188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tedyu","html_url":"https://github.com/tedyu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tedyu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tedyu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tedyu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tedyu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tedyu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tedyu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tedyu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tedyu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tedyu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-02-20T18:34:15Z","updated_at":"2021-02-20T22:44:05Z","body":"I added some log statements in operator> of Selectivity.\r\nIt seems primary index is among the candidates. However, due to the covers_fully attribute being considered later in the comparator, secondary index is chosen.\r\n\r\nEven though moving the following to immediately after comparison of full_table_scan_:\r\n```\r\n    // If one covers the read fully and the other does not, prefer the one that does.\r\n    if (covers_fully_ != other.covers_fully_) {\r\n      return covers_fully_ > other.covers_fully_;\r\n    }\r\n```\r\nwould yield the new order among the candidates:\r\n```\r\nts3|pid3780462|:13544|http://127.58.179.135:25081 I0220 18:27:38.814424 3780545 pt_select.cc:526] there are 2 selectivities\r\nts3|pid3780462|:13544|http://127.58.179.135:25081 I0220 18:27:38.814496 3780545 pt_select.cc:528] Selectivity: index_id  is_local true prefix_length 1 single_key_read true full_table_scan false ends_with_range false covers_fully true\r\nts3|pid3780462|:13544|http://127.58.179.135:25081 I0220 18:27:38.814504 3780545 pt_select.cc:528] Selectivity: index_id 763671a3c371477bb8856936a5fec8b7 is_local false prefix_length 2 single_key_read true full_table_scan false ends_with_range false covers_fully false\r\n```\r\nand primary index being chosen:\r\n```\r\nts3|pid3780462|:13544|http://127.58.179.135:25081 I0220 18:27:38.814510 3780545 pt_select.cc:536] Selected = Selectivity: index_id  is_local true prefix_length 1 single_key_read true full_table_scan false ends_with_range false covers_fully true\r\n```\r\nthe change would make QLTestAnalyzer.TestIndexSelection fail because there're cases where index with longer prefix would be preferred.\r\n\r\nInvestigating the case of prefix_length for secondary index being longer (as shown in example above) and yet primary index should be chosen.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/782729565/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"tedyu","id":235188,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNTE4OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/235188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tedyu","html